      "line": {
        "zu": {
          "id": "zu.l11-inmd.t06",
          "text": "Lalela umehluko: lokhu ukuqhafaza kwesiZulu, futhi lokhu ngu-k wesiNgisi. Egameni elithi cat, sisebenzisa u-k.",
